              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naayaka enju ya Daudi obugabe, naabukuha; kwonka iwe tiwambeera nk'omwiru wangye Daudi, owaabaire ayorobera ebiragiro byangye, nankuratira n'omutima gwe gwona, naakora ebi ndikusiima byonka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
