            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba MUKAMA aryateera Abaisraeli, babe nk'ekifunjo ekirikutengyetsibwa amaizi, abarandure omuri egi nsi nungi e i yaahaire baishenkurubo, abataataanisize seeri y'omugyera Fraati, ahabw'okuba bakeekorera Asherimu, baagwisa kubi MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
