        },
        {
          "text": " Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani akategyekyera omuri Yuda. Obu yaaza aha ngoma, akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ana na gumwe, yaamara emyaka ikumi na mushanju naategyeka omuri Yerusaalemu, orurembo oru MUKAMA yaatooraine omu nganda za Israeli zoona, ngu abe nimwo yaata eiziina rye. Kandi nyina akaba naayetwa Naama Omwamonikazi. ",
