          "text": " Ahabw'okuba bakeeyombekyera amaju omu myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, n'nyomyo, na Asherimu, ahari buri kibungo kiraingwa, n'ahansi ya buri kiti ekyetwa omurinzi; ",
